4
00:00:12.902 --> 00:00:17.271
Today we learn about Understanding Cloud Storage. Let's go!

5
00:00:18.868 --> 00:00:23.697
Cloud storage. Say it with me. Cloud storage!

6
00:00:27.182 --> 00:00:31.500
Upload. Say it with me. Upload!

7
00:00:34.969 --> 00:00:38.533
Sync. Say it with me. Sync!

8
00:00:42.064 --> 00:00:47.097
Access anywhere. Say it with me. Access anywhere!

9
00:00:50.591 --> 00:00:54.491
Backup. Say it with me. Backup!

10
00:00:57.949 --> 00:01:02.534
Storage space. Say it with me. Storage space!

11
00:01:06.048 --> 00:01:10.581
File sharing. Say it with me. File sharing!

12
00:01:14.074 --> 00:01:17.922
Server. Say it with me. Server!

13
00:01:21.449 --> 00:01:31.085
Cloud storage lets me upload a file to a server, sync it, and access it anywhere. It serves as a backup and supports file sharing.

14
00:01:31.135 --> 00:01:34.297
Now I understand. Thank you, Ms. Emily!

15
00:01:35.037 --> 00:01:40.456
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:40.506 --> 00:01:41.656
Sync!

17
00:01:42.545 --> 00:01:47.899
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:47.949 --> 00:01:49.363
File sharing!

19
00:01:50.573 --> 00:01:58.608
Did you know? Cloud storage companies keep multiple copies of your files on different servers to help prevent data loss!

20
00:01:58.658 --> 00:02:00.966
