21
00:02:02.076 --> 00:02:12.726
Think and answer. Why might cloud storage be useful if your device is lost or broken?

22
00:02:12.776 --> 00:02:14.049
Great answer!

23
00:02:15.009 --> 00:02:20.805
Great job today! Keep learning, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
